From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: incari-client <335801235+incari-client@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:59:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] modules: Let modules see a spear's stab

A piercing weapon's attack returned before the attack hook, so Hit & Kill
Effects and Reach Display never saw it.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/Minecraft.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/Minecraft.java
index ed622c7ad27f79afb988acf237ccfb8298fc10f7..a349a50049e75179aa64e528553d4e6dcdf3302d 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/Minecraft.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/Minecraft.java
@@ -1708,2 +1708,5 @@
                     this.gameMode.piercingAttack(attackAnimation, piercingWeapon);
+                    // Incari start: modules see a spear's stab too (Hit & Kill Effects, Reach Display)
+                    incari.client.modules.ModuleInput.stabbed(this.player, this.hitResult);
+                    // Incari end
                     return true;
